    "reason": "[ev-9e92c97ef99e] is a one-line changelog entry. It says only that service health checks gain gRPC support, which is an addition, and points to PR #8583, which is not shown. It does not name the configuration that turns gRPC health checking on (an option, mode or field), its default, or which providers or service types it applies to. Without that, no declarative condition for exposed environments can be written. The surrounding Enhancements section adds nothing about this change, and no upgrade-guide section is shown, so the applicability aspect needs the PR or the health-check documentation.",
